 "anterior": "CL022",
 "titulo": "Planting day in a Japanese village, 1700 🌱 Part 2 #history #shorts",
 "capa": "THE WHOLE VILLAGE PLANTS",
 "descripcion": "In June, the whole village planted rice together, field by field, and shared the same water.\n\nSources: Edo-period village life (goningumi, shared irrigation).\n\nWhat would you have done?\n\n#history #edojapan #japanesehistory #historyfacts #shorts",
 "lineas": [
  {
   "texto": "Your neighbor was hiding rice, to sell it in secret.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "At night, you saw him carry sacks to a man from the town.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "If the lord finds out, your five families pay.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Whipping, fines, maybe land taken. For all of you.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Telling the headman would save you. But he's your neighbor.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "You talk to him before anyone else does. He stops.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Next spring, he helps you fix your roof. He never says why.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "In June, the whole village plants together, one field at a time.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Rice planting can't wait. The seedlings must go in on time.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Ankle-deep in mud, bent over, singing to keep the rhythm.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Women plant, men carry seedlings, children chase off the birds.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "The water is shared. You never open your channel first.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Water flows from field to field, in a fixed order.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "A fight over water can split a village for generations.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "And you don't eat your rice. You eat millet and barley.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "White rice is for festivals, and for the sick.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "The rice is for the tax. How much? Part three, {when_next}.",
   "pausa": 0.3
  }
 ],
